WEBVTT

00:01.560 --> 00:06.390
Great Japanese Empire Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures, 1st Counter Dept. Captain, Midarezaki Ouka, age 27.

00:06.390 --> 00:13.830
Through a twist of fate or some conspiracy, I was forced to marry a self-proclaimed almighty god with cat ears.

00:13.830 --> 00:20.820
Add to that, I became the father of three humans, a lion, a jellyfish, and a biological weapon...

00:20.820 --> 00:23.340
...in a cozy family life, an assignment I'm not sure that is drab or flashy.

00:23.340 --> 00:27.080
Off we went on a honeymoon and the plane crashed.

00:27.080 --> 00:29.920
We drifted to an island and had
our precious daughter, Yuuka, kidnapped.

00:29.920 --> 00:34.430
Not to mention an island in the sky fell and I was getting completely sick of my life,

00:34.430 --> 00:36.640
but strangely, I've been getting used to it recently.

00:36.640 --> 00:40.010
I'm Midarezaki Ginka working at the gay bar, Virgo, age 23.

00:40.010 --> 00:41.970
One day I was told that I was a Child of Enka
and became the first son of an off-the-walls big family...

00:41.970 --> 00:47.850
...composed of four humans, one cat ears,
one lion, one jellyfish, and one biological weapon.

00:47.850 --> 00:51.780
This, in itself, is fun, and above all, Father's
a good-looking man, just the way I like them.

00:51.780 --> 00:56.340
Just when I thought a wonderful life was waiting,
Father's self-proclaimed masked ex-girlfriend showed up,

00:56.340 --> 00:59.910
swinging a sword and tossing bombs,
throwing an amusement park into chaos.

00:59.910 --> 01:02.510
But with my love-love power,
we took care of the masked girl.

01:02.510 --> 01:04.120
We regained Father's love.

01:04.370 --> 01:06.340
Mi-Mi-Mi-Midarezaki Teika, age 7.

01:06.340 --> 01:12.200
Living in the Savannah as the last of the Bister Kings, I was told by humans I was an important being called a Child of Enka.

01:12.200 --> 01:16.630
Without much explanation, I was brought to the Great Japanese Empire to live as the second son of a family of eight.

01:16.630 --> 01:20.050
However, Honored Sister was a transformation cyborg heroine while Gekka and I were evil lords.

01:20.050 --> 01:23.630
At the island, I was forced to dance, and at the
amusement park, Father's face almost got destroyed.

01:23.630 --> 01:26.980
After Hyouka experienced his first love, people in the city began changing into animals one after another-

01:27.070 --> 01:28.480
Are you all right, Teika?

01:28.480 --> 01:30.170
I bit my tongue.

01:30.170 --> 01:32.230
You didn't have to talk so fast.

01:32.230 --> 01:34.990
Either way, why are we narrating this summary?

01:34.990 --> 01:37.070
Isn't this usually Kyouka's job?

01:37.070 --> 01:38.320
We have a note from her.

01:38.320 --> 01:42.100
Since you guys don't get to to talk much in the show,
I'll give you a chance to make an impression on the viewers.

01:42.100 --> 01:43.540
Three minutes! Finish in three minutes!

01:43.540 --> 01:44.330
So she says.

01:44.330 --> 01:46.830
That cat-ear is talking nonsense as always.

01:46.830 --> 01:50.130
It's an undeniable fact that I don't stand out.

01:50.130 --> 01:52.700
Oh, Teika-chan looks depressed.

01:52.700 --> 01:59.680
I was only in the corner of the screen in both
the honeymoon arc and the Father-cheating arc.

01:59.680 --> 02:01.430
Don't be so self-critical.

02:01.430 --> 02:03.350
I thought you were doing pretty well.

02:03.350 --> 02:07.520
But these days, I'm nothing more than Honored Sister's feet or her cushion.

02:07.520 --> 02:14.240
The other day, she was asked by a neighbor,
"Your dog has a great fur. What do you feed him?"

02:14.240 --> 02:15.370
What humiliation!

02:15.370 --> 02:18.710
I can forgive being called a pet, but a lion is a cat!

02:18.710 --> 02:20.120
So you don't mind being called a pet?

02:20.120 --> 02:23.820
It might be from the stress, but recently, I've been shedding severely.

02:23.820 --> 02:27.450
So that's the reason why I've been collecting
so much of your hair every time I vacuum the floor.

02:27.450 --> 02:29.410
I am at my limits.

02:29.410 --> 02:32.610
I am a descendant of the honorable Bister Kings.

02:32.610 --> 02:37.590
At times, I want to chase after my prey and chew on its blood-drenched meat!

02:37.590 --> 02:41.850
I understand your feelings, but please restrain yourself from chewing blood-soaked meat on the streets.

02:41.850 --> 02:43.800
It must be difficult for you, Teika-chan.

02:43.800 --> 02:45.350
Oh look, the time's running out.

02:45.350 --> 02:49.450
And I guess you'll find out why Mother's not around if you watch the show.

02:49.450 --> 02:52.410
I'm pretty sure it's a lousy excuse, but in any case,

02:52.410 --> 02:54.230
Kyouran Kazoku Nikki is starting.

02:54.230 --> 02:55.730
I want to chew!

02:55.900 --> 02:57.730
Chew meat!

02:57.730 --> 02:58.990
Meat!!!

04:19.480 --> 04:21.400
Don't swear to someone else. Swear to yourself.

04:21.400 --> 04:24.240
Swear to yourself that you will watch the Midarezaki frenzy.

04:24.240 --> 04:26.060
When you do, the door shall open!

04:26.060 --> 04:28.280
Pigs! Drown in your tears of joy!

04:48.140 --> 04:49.510
What was that about?!

04:51.730 --> 04:52.600
Kyouka!

04:52.600 --> 04:54.640
Ouka! Perfect timing!

04:54.640 --> 04:56.650
I just finished making it.

04:56.650 --> 04:57.490
Finished?

04:57.490 --> 04:58.150
That's right!

04:58.150 --> 04:58.900
Finished making what?

05:00.730 --> 05:03.050
Tada!

05:03.050 --> 05:04.000
What is that?

05:04.000 --> 05:05.610
Kyouka-sama's special cake!

05:05.610 --> 05:08.100
Let me ask again. What is that?

05:08.100 --> 05:09.900
Kyouka-sama's special cake!

05:13.700 --> 05:16.870
Come Ouka! Enjoy while you drown in tears of joy!

05:16.870 --> 05:17.830
No, thank you!

05:19.880 --> 05:21.890
Just eat it!

05:20.630 --> 05:22.390
I said, "No, thank you".

05:22.380 --> 05:24.300
No, thank you!

05:22.390 --> 05:24.320
Eat it!

05:24.320 --> 05:25.880
Eat it!

05:25.880 --> 05:26.760
Eat!

05:28.270 --> 05:29.630
No worries, Darling.

05:29.630 --> 05:31.880
I know it looks bad, but have
a bite and your tongue will melt,

05:31.880 --> 05:33.350
and the second bite will take you
to Heaven with a shortage of breath,

05:33.350 --> 05:35.390
along with an irregular heartbeat!

05:35.390 --> 05:37.310
That's clearly poison then...

05:36.520 --> 05:38.900
Take a third bite and you'll be spitting some strange light out of your mouth going,

05:38.900 --> 05:41.310
"It's exquisite!"

05:41.310 --> 05:43.940
I made it for you, so eat it this moment!

05:43.940 --> 05:45.900
I stayed up all night making it!

05:45.900 --> 05:46.910
If you won't eat it...

05:46.910 --> 05:49.710
Kyouka! Stop! What is wrong with you?

05:52.010 --> 05:54.550
You really don't know what today is?

05:55.210 --> 05:56.830
Ah...

06:02.180 --> 06:03.100
Kyouka?

06:03.100 --> 06:05.590
Ouka... You...

06:05.590 --> 06:08.710
You jerk!

06:10.590 --> 06:13.620
And she ran out of the house just like that?

06:13.620 --> 06:15.600
Yes, she was furious.

06:17.020 --> 06:18.480
Poor Mother.

06:18.480 --> 06:20.780
Why do you side with Kyouka after that story?

06:20.780 --> 06:23.410
Since I'm gay, I understand the heart of girls really well.

06:24.480 --> 06:26.490
What is this about, then?

06:26.490 --> 06:27.790
Then let me ask.

06:28.520 --> 06:31.250
Have you noticed that band-aids and gauze have been running low?

06:35.080 --> 06:37.940
But why would she do that today?

06:37.940 --> 06:39.880
Perhaps a birthday? But whose?

06:41.560 --> 06:43.700
You're the densest species alive.

06:44.650 --> 06:48.400
Isn't today your first anniversary, Hubby?

07:00.140 --> 07:02.440
I got the same thing again!

07:01.410 --> 07:03.180
Let's go home now, Mother.

07:03.180 --> 07:05.910
Ouka, that stupid idiot! Slow! Dense! Bean sprout! Glasses!

07:04.700 --> 07:05.890
Mother.

07:05.910 --> 07:07.050
Is glasses even an insult?

07:06.660 --> 07:07.830
Mother.

07:07.050 --> 07:07.600
Oh, who cares!

07:07.600 --> 07:10.670
Ouka, that stupid idiot! Slow! Dense! Bean sprout! Glasses!

07:08.880 --> 07:10.150
Mother.

07:10.670 --> 07:11.620
Did I just repeat myself?

07:10.920 --> 07:12.190
Mother!

07:11.620 --> 07:12.660
Oh, who cares! Next!

07:12.710 --> 07:14.800
You shouldn't waste money, Mother.

07:14.800 --> 07:16.060
I'll get him...

07:16.060 --> 07:18.040
I'll get my revenge on Ouka.

07:18.040 --> 07:18.910
Revenge?

07:18.910 --> 07:20.030
Let's go, Hyouka!

07:20.030 --> 07:21.120
Go where?

07:22.030 --> 07:23.250
There, of course!

07:24.100 --> 07:27.260
Yay! It's Salon de Clear's shortcake!

07:27.260 --> 07:31.320
It's a limited offer of thirty a day, but I made my subordinate go buy it for me, so it was so easy to get a hold of.

07:31.320 --> 07:33.090
Authority is amazing.

07:33.090 --> 07:34.800
Look at you eating sweets like that again.

07:34.800 --> 07:35.720
You'll get fat, you know?

07:35.720 --> 07:37.430
Cute girls never gain weight!

07:38.240 --> 07:40.950
Well, it might be to your benefit to gain some weight and increase some crucial fat.

07:44.370 --> 07:46.870
And now, itadakimasu.

07:46.870 --> 07:51.070
...masu...

07:49.480 --> 07:53.570
Kyouka-sama Shooting Star Kick!

07:57.630 --> 07:59.940
Hey, Hyouka, do you hear me?

07:59.940 --> 08:01.280
Yes, yes, I hear you.

08:01.280 --> 08:02.710
That launch was a success.

08:02.710 --> 08:04.830
You're getting better at it.

08:04.830 --> 08:06.710
Yeah, thanks. That's great.

08:06.710 --> 08:09.460
Hey, don't you have something to say first?!

08:09.460 --> 08:12.160
I'm sorry! I have a favor to ask you!

08:12.160 --> 08:17.240
It's this and that, so I want to punish Ouka!
Could you lend me some dirty items to use against him?!

08:17.630 --> 08:18.890
Hey, are you listening to me?

08:18.890 --> 08:20.220
Listen to me!

08:22.010 --> 08:24.520
I'm telling you to give me an item to crack Ouka's head open with!

08:24.520 --> 08:25.400
Get off of me first!

08:25.400 --> 08:26.040
Okay.

08:26.040 --> 08:29.480
I don't understand what's going on,
but I clearly understand what you want to do.

08:34.570 --> 08:35.520
What is this?

08:35.520 --> 08:41.510
We've got lots of magic items stored here,
but this one is among the most dangerous.

08:41.510 --> 08:42.000
Spider.

08:42.000 --> 08:42.410
Right here!

08:48.130 --> 08:48.920
Th-This is...

08:48.920 --> 08:49.880
A wand?

08:49.880 --> 08:50.960
A wand?

08:50.960 --> 08:52.910
A magic wand?!

08:52.910 --> 08:56.430
Numerous Bureau members died in order to get ahold of this item.

08:56.430 --> 08:57.750
This is a little...

08:57.750 --> 09:02.520
That wand changes people's feelings of love to a negative energy.

09:02.520 --> 09:05.770
Not too sure what negative energy is,
but this is a little heavy to swing around.

09:05.770 --> 09:08.470
This is how you use it!

09:14.880 --> 09:15.950
Come on.

09:17.020 --> 09:18.450
What is it this time?

09:19.030 --> 09:20.200
Sushi?

09:21.200 --> 09:22.450
Why is sushi here?

09:22.450 --> 09:23.660
Watch closely.

09:23.660 --> 09:25.620
Target locked on.

09:27.870 --> 09:29.350
Something shot out!

09:29.350 --> 09:30.670
What's that? What's that?

09:39.470 --> 09:44.970
Just like that, it converts love into energy and uses it to attack.

09:45.320 --> 09:47.530
In case of Gekka-chan, it was sushi,

09:47.880 --> 09:52.600
but if you want to attack Ouka-kun,
point the wand at someone that loves Ouka-kun.

09:53.060 --> 09:54.410
I like its flashiness.

09:54.410 --> 09:55.360
I'm glad to hear that.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.860
Let me try it, too!

09:58.860 --> 10:00.510
What? Hey, come back out!

10:01.470 --> 10:03.070
Just as I thought.

10:03.070 --> 10:06.500
You have a fatal flaw as a magical girl!

10:06.500 --> 10:08.370
F-Fatal flaw?

10:08.370 --> 10:10.010
What? What is it?

10:10.010 --> 10:10.530
It is...

10:10.530 --> 10:11.270
It is?

10:11.270 --> 10:14.480
...You're already twenty years old and married!

10:14.480 --> 10:15.610
H-How could that be...

10:22.100 --> 10:24.600
W-What a terrifying reality.

10:24.600 --> 10:28.600
If you think about it,
a twenty year old wife being a magical girl?

10:28.600 --> 10:30.600
It can't get any more wrong!

10:31.730 --> 10:34.350
I think no one cares!

10:34.350 --> 10:36.500
It's too early to give up.

10:36.500 --> 10:40.240
Even if you're twenty and married,
as long as your heart is filled with dreams,

10:40.240 --> 10:42.800
I'm sure you can use magic!

10:42.800 --> 10:46.080
H-Have dreams in my heart?

10:47.910 --> 10:50.210
Activate Magical Girl Education System!

10:50.210 --> 10:52.790
It is time to show the true power hidden in this building!

10:52.790 --> 10:53.420
What's happening?

10:53.420 --> 10:55.380
Magical Girl, Kyouka Program!

10:55.380 --> 10:57.670
In other words, Kyouka, it's a system to train you.

10:58.780 --> 10:59.920
Train...

11:02.890 --> 11:06.140
Observe my hard training!

11:06.140 --> 11:07.350
Destruction!

11:11.900 --> 11:13.360
You're doing great!

11:13.360 --> 11:15.040
You're now a magical girl.

11:15.040 --> 11:16.010
Or rather...

11:16.010 --> 11:17.480
A mage!

11:32.330 --> 11:34.080
I'm a mage.

11:34.080 --> 11:36.590
What is this transformation sequence about?

11:36.590 --> 11:38.820
Kyouka-sama's new style.

11:40.900 --> 11:42.510
Oh fine.

11:47.500 --> 11:48.770
It's perfect!

11:48.770 --> 11:50.620
This outfit comes with great power?

11:50.620 --> 11:52.290
No, this is purely my taste.

11:51.690 --> 11:52.770
Your taste?

11:52.290 --> 11:54.520
Hauu~ Taking it home!

11:55.830 --> 11:57.950
Mother, why am I here with you?

11:57.950 --> 12:00.580
A mage needs a pet character with her.

12:00.580 --> 12:01.400
Pet character?

12:01.400 --> 12:03.140
Forget the details. Let's go.

12:03.140 --> 12:05.200
Let me warn you of one thing.

12:05.200 --> 12:08.720
The wand creates more power the stronger the love is.

12:08.720 --> 12:12.370
In some cases, enough to kill.

12:13.540 --> 12:15.530
There's only one way to stop cases like that.

12:15.530 --> 12:17.640
Break the core of the wand.

12:17.640 --> 12:22.170
However, the energy will come rushing back to you with no direction.

12:23.410 --> 12:25.930
You'll be in big trouble, Kyouka-chan.

12:25.930 --> 12:27.580
It's an unnecessary warning.

12:26.590 --> 12:27.970
That hurts.

12:27.580 --> 12:31.560
I will show that stupid Ouka this Kyouka-sama's anger!

12:27.970 --> 12:30.060
Ow! Ow! That hurts!

12:32.200 --> 12:33.370
There they go.

12:33.370 --> 12:34.890
I can't wait to see what happens.

12:36.980 --> 12:39.560
Oh yeah, go buy me a new cake.

12:39.560 --> 12:41.170
Please do some work.

12:58.040 --> 12:59.790
There she is!

12:59.790 --> 13:02.450
Who are you looking for, Mother?

13:02.450 --> 13:04.520
This wand reacts to love.

13:04.520 --> 13:08.220
In other words, I must look for people who hold Ouka dear.

13:08.220 --> 13:11.560
There's a perfect person for that,
although her love's a little skewed.

13:11.560 --> 13:13.660
Today's prey was an easy kill.

13:13.660 --> 13:17.060
Sparring against Ouka-san is much more tense.

13:17.060 --> 13:18.020
Ah, Ouka-san!

13:18.020 --> 13:20.200
What a perfect situation.

13:20.200 --> 13:21.170
Are we really doing this?

13:21.170 --> 13:22.190
Of course.

13:25.130 --> 13:26.450
Desire. Assurance. You're thinking wrong.

13:26.450 --> 13:27.870
Got a tail and flick the sky.

13:27.310 --> 13:28.560
Mother, what's that supposed to mean?

13:28.560 --> 13:31.770
Mages always come with a nonsensical, but lively, chant.

13:38.570 --> 13:40.200
Target locked on.

13:40.200 --> 13:43.090
Take this! Magical Wife Punisher!

13:43.090 --> 13:44.630
Hey, Shiruku.

13:44.630 --> 13:45.750
Oh, hi, Father.

13:46.840 --> 13:48.260
What? That's strange.

13:48.260 --> 13:49.590
Do we still have an enemy here?

13:49.590 --> 13:50.520
Where is it?

13:50.960 --> 13:52.220
Shiruku...

13:52.220 --> 13:53.380
Hang in there, Father!

13:53.380 --> 13:54.580
No big deal. Let's try again.

13:54.580 --> 13:56.480
Magical Wife Punisher!

13:57.060 --> 13:57.980
What is going on?

13:57.980 --> 13:58.880
Take this!

14:00.510 --> 14:03.170
Why? I want to punish Ouka!

14:02.260 --> 14:05.480
An unrelated person's getting punished mercilessly.

14:04.750 --> 14:06.490
This piece of junk!

14:07.740 --> 14:10.160
It won't listen at all!

14:10.160 --> 14:14.410
You've got to use it when she's thinking about Ouka-kun.

14:14.410 --> 14:15.050
What?

14:15.050 --> 14:17.720
Strong items come with lots of regulations.

14:17.720 --> 14:18.750
For example...

14:20.290 --> 14:23.070
You look simply great, Onee-sama!

14:23.420 --> 14:24.210
Thank you.

14:24.800 --> 14:26.990
You look cute, too, Yuuka-chan.

14:26.990 --> 14:28.090
Y-You think so?

14:28.090 --> 14:31.400
Then would Dad say I look cute?

14:31.840 --> 14:33.010
I'm sure he would.

14:33.010 --> 14:33.860
Chance.

14:33.860 --> 14:35.600
Desire. Assurance. You're... How did it go?

14:34.290 --> 14:38.690
Ow! It hurts! It hurts!

14:35.770 --> 14:36.680
Oh who cares.

14:36.680 --> 14:38.690
Take the wrath for making me cry, Ouka!

14:38.690 --> 14:41.440
But why not show it to another boy?

14:41.440 --> 14:43.270
Like, your classmate Yamada-kun?

14:43.270 --> 14:46.570
N-No! Yamaguchi-kun and I are nothing like that!

14:45.530 --> 14:46.190
What?

14:46.570 --> 14:53.440
For example, if the person you point the wand at has someone else on their mind and happens to be thinking of that person...

14:48.530 --> 14:50.860
No! No! No!

14:52.120 --> 14:54.910
Take this, the ultimate kick, Drive-

14:54.420 --> 14:57.290
The wand attacks that person.

14:58.730 --> 15:01.000
His shot is shining!

15:01.000 --> 15:03.290
He's really shooting an ultimate shot!

15:04.180 --> 15:06.210
Drive Shoot!

15:06.210 --> 15:07.680
Damn it, I missed him.

15:07.680 --> 15:11.000
Mother... Honored Sister's boyfriend was over at the elementary school...

15:11.000 --> 15:12.050
Not yet. I still have a chance.

15:12.050 --> 15:16.310
I know it'd be hard with Ginichi-san, but I'm sure I can beat Ouka-san.

15:16.310 --> 15:18.680
It's a questionable statement out of her,
but here's my next chance!

15:18.680 --> 15:21.060
Take this! Magical Wife-

15:20.310 --> 15:24.480
Just kidding. I wonder why Ginichi-san won't understand me.

15:23.770 --> 15:24.480
What?

15:24.480 --> 15:26.110
Target locked on.

15:27.300 --> 15:28.000
Why?!

15:28.000 --> 15:30.410
Mother, I think it's about time you gave up.

15:30.410 --> 15:32.570
What do you think about this, Nee-sama?

15:32.660 --> 15:34.740
I think it'll look good on Teika-kun.

15:35.870 --> 15:38.970
How about this? It should look great on Kitty.

15:38.970 --> 15:39.750
You're right.

15:39.750 --> 15:41.160
Then how about this?

15:41.160 --> 15:42.670
Maybe these, too.

15:42.670 --> 15:44.250
How about this?

15:44.250 --> 15:45.750
Maybe we'll get this.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.630
It was so noisy in there, don't you think?

15:48.630 --> 15:50.010
I wonder what was going on.

15:51.510 --> 15:54.930
Mother. At this rate, our bodies won't last.

15:54.930 --> 15:57.180
No! I'm going to make Ouka suffer!

15:57.180 --> 15:59.500
I'll do whatever it takes!

15:59.500 --> 16:00.430
Mother!

16:03.260 --> 16:04.900
I won't die from this!

16:04.900 --> 16:06.900
Thank you very much.

16:06.900 --> 16:09.420
Do you think they'll like it?

16:10.150 --> 16:13.910
To find out, we need Kitty to come home first.

16:14.850 --> 16:15.910
You're right.

16:16.620 --> 16:19.040
Looks like this was their purpose in shopping.

16:19.040 --> 16:25.190
Anyway, Ouka-san is one of the densest people alive to forget their wedding anniversary.

16:25.190 --> 16:27.170
It's no surprise that Kitty got angry.

16:27.170 --> 16:29.210
I can kind of understand.

16:29.210 --> 16:33.400
After becoming a family, the days spent with everyone are simply fun.

16:33.400 --> 16:35.430
I want to make every day an anniversary!

16:35.430 --> 16:36.690
Yuuka-chan.

16:36.690 --> 16:40.670
So I bet the anniversary didn't mean anything to Dad.

16:42.510 --> 16:44.990
I think he likes Mom every day.

16:45.440 --> 16:46.790
I'm sure of it.

16:47.790 --> 16:50.530
I agree with Honored Sister.

16:51.690 --> 16:57.990
Rather than making anniversaries,
don't true feelings exist in daily life?

16:59.330 --> 16:59.990
Yuuka-chan!

16:59.990 --> 17:01.540
Ow...

17:01.540 --> 17:02.490
The cake!

17:04.190 --> 17:06.750
Look! My Bro's shoe got dirty!

17:06.750 --> 17:09.130
See this mess on the tip of his toe?

17:09.130 --> 17:10.920
What are you going to do about this?

17:10.920 --> 17:12.010
I-I'm sorry!

17:12.010 --> 17:14.920
Huh? If "sorry" solved problems, then we wouldn't need cops.

17:14.920 --> 17:17.490
Step outside! Right, Bro?

17:18.110 --> 17:22.260
Hey, you hear? Eh? Eh? Eh? Eh? Eh? Step outside, damn it!

17:23.020 --> 17:25.440
Hey you. What are you pulling against a child?

17:25.440 --> 17:27.870
Hot! Hot hot hot hot hot HOT!

17:27.870 --> 17:29.220
What the hell are you?!

17:29.220 --> 17:32.940
Get your filthy face out of our sight this instant!

17:32.940 --> 17:37.030
You sound pretty tough,
but my Bro actually prefers that more.

17:37.790 --> 17:40.830
See? So come with me a bit, will you?

17:39.370 --> 17:40.650
Ow!

17:41.390 --> 17:43.090
Hey, let go of me!

17:43.390 --> 17:47.960
Don't worry. In front of the queen, my Bro's a cute obedient puppy.

17:47.960 --> 17:49.980
Stop it!

17:49.980 --> 17:52.170
Ma~gi~ca~l...

17:52.170 --> 17:52.960
Magical?

17:57.570 --> 17:59.220
Kyouka-sama Dynamic.

18:01.350 --> 18:02.830
Roar.

18:06.930 --> 18:07.640
Justice has been done.

18:08.510 --> 18:10.400
Mother? And Teika-kun?

18:10.400 --> 18:14.900
No! No! I'm not your mother who you respect so greatly.

18:14.900 --> 18:17.390
Magical Wife, Absolute Kyoukya-sama.

18:17.390 --> 18:20.970
I'll drop divine punishment on those who don't understand the heart of girls!

18:20.970 --> 18:22.570
What are you doing, Kitty?

18:22.570 --> 18:23.480
We're getting out of here, Teika.

18:23.480 --> 18:24.330
Right with you.

18:24.330 --> 18:25.410
Mom!

18:25.850 --> 18:26.950
We'll be waiting!

18:26.950 --> 18:30.060
Me, Nee-sama, Ginka-san, Hyouka, and Gekka.

18:30.060 --> 18:32.040
And Dad, too.

18:33.680 --> 18:35.090
We'll be waiting!

18:37.530 --> 18:39.610
The sun's about to set.

18:41.050 --> 18:44.940
Honored Sister said Father's waiting.

18:45.560 --> 18:46.810
I heard it.

18:50.430 --> 18:51.850
Mother?

18:59.360 --> 19:00.360
Welcome home.

19:00.860 --> 19:02.640
You must be hungry.

19:02.640 --> 19:05.730
I-I didn't come home because I'm hungry.

19:05.730 --> 19:07.700
Yes, I know.

19:07.700 --> 19:09.440
No, you don't.

19:12.590 --> 19:13.380
Kyouka.

19:14.380 --> 19:16.120
I was at fault this morning.

19:16.430 --> 19:17.130
Ouka.

19:17.790 --> 19:22.130
I didn't think you cared about the anniversary so much.

19:23.200 --> 19:24.760
What about you, Ouka?

19:24.850 --> 19:27.120
I don't need to ask myself what I think.

19:27.120 --> 19:28.770
Tell me what you think!

19:32.000 --> 19:35.020
Honestly, at first I was doing this for the sake of the mission.

19:35.020 --> 19:40.600
But... as I spent the frenzy days with everyone, laughing, and crying,

19:40.600 --> 19:44.680
before I noticed it, everyone had become an irreplaceable part of the family.

19:44.680 --> 19:45.860
And Kyouka.

19:45.860 --> 19:48.540
You're my precious wife.

19:49.580 --> 19:51.980
You look pretty good the way you look right now, too.

19:51.980 --> 19:54.340
Though, it looks so good on you, I worry a little.

19:54.340 --> 19:55.810
What are you saying all of a sudden?

19:55.960 --> 19:57.750
Did it just react to me?

20:00.340 --> 20:02.220
Oh no, at this rate...

20:02.970 --> 20:04.680
Ouka will... Ouka will...

20:05.910 --> 20:06.970
What do I do?

20:07.100 --> 20:09.190
What should I do?!

20:09.190 --> 20:11.390
There's only one way to stop cases like that.

20:11.390 --> 20:13.730
Break the core of the wand.

20:13.730 --> 20:17.820
However, the energy will come rushing back to you with no direction.

20:17.820 --> 20:18.610
Kyouka?

20:18.610 --> 20:19.360
Kyouka?

20:21.690 --> 20:25.200
No matter what happens to me, Ouka...

20:25.200 --> 20:28.700
I won't let you die!

20:32.290 --> 20:32.830
Kyouka!

20:38.960 --> 20:42.220
Ouka!

20:40.560 --> 20:41.420
Kyouka!

20:57.660 --> 20:59.650
W-W-W-

20:59.650 --> 21:03.260
WHAT THE?!

21:05.290 --> 21:06.820
All in all, it worked out pretty well.

21:07.620 --> 21:11.110
I don't want them to be in a fight at this busy time.

21:11.110 --> 21:12.300
I brought the cake.

21:12.700 --> 21:14.500
I've been waiting for it!

21:18.420 --> 21:19.970
Everyone's late.

21:19.970 --> 21:21.070
Yeah.

21:21.560 --> 21:23.540
The food will get cold.

21:23.540 --> 21:24.300
I suppose.

21:25.180 --> 21:26.470
Ouka, um...

21:27.090 --> 21:28.090
Next time...

21:29.290 --> 21:31.600
Will you eat it next time?

21:32.640 --> 21:34.140
I'll be ready for it.

21:34.840 --> 21:35.670
You jerk.

21:41.270 --> 21:43.820
I can't believe they didn't make any progress all night.

21:43.820 --> 21:44.940
Thanks to them, we couldn't get any sleep.

21:44.940 --> 21:46.740
You said you'd be ready for it!

21:46.740 --> 21:49.360
Hold! That's obviously dangerous!

21:49.360 --> 21:50.900
You said you'd be ready for it!

21:50.900 --> 21:52.750
Someone, help me!

21:52.750 --> 21:54.040
Hey, anyone?!

21:54.040 --> 21:55.290
You're joking...

21:59.800 --> 22:00.960
Darling.

22:01.420 --> 22:04.210
Say "ah".

23:41.060 --> 23:41.890
Teika speaking.

23:42.320 --> 23:45.480
I'm a descendant of the noble Bister Kings.

23:45.480 --> 23:47.860
Teika-kun, let's go to the zoo.

23:47.860 --> 23:48.570
Come on!

23:48.570 --> 23:50.610
I am a noble...

23:50.610 --> 23:53.040
Next time. Red and White Brindle.
